    "detailed_description": "Want to be dragged across the floor?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDark Past is evolved around trying to emulate &quot;spiritual&quot; entity experiences.  Explore different houses, use different equipment to identify the entity types.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExorcism<br />\r\nAttempt to get rid of the entity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLose Control<br />\r\nDuring your investigation you might lose control over your player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMultiplayer<br />\r\nPlay alone or in a group of up to 4 players. More teammates means a higher chance of success when venturing into larger haunted locations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpeech Recognition<br />\r\nDark Past will allow you to use your microphone to interact with the paranormal entities but only for a Ouija board. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nProximity Voice<br />\r\nBe prepared to communicate with your team using the in-game proximity voice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCharacter Customisation<br />\r\nCustomise your characters as you see fit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVarious Entity Types<br />\r\nThere are several entity behaviour profiles. Each entity will have a randomized type (Shadow, Poltergeist, Demon etc), set of evidence to collect, and behaviour.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifficulty<br />\r\nCurrently 3 levels of difficulty, each level changes the outcome of what's to come!",
